---------------------+-----------------------
 range_agg           | [0:0]={anymultirange}
 range_agg           | [0:0]={anyrange}
 range_intersect_agg | [0:0]={anymultirange}
 range_intersect_agg | [0:0]={anyrange}
(4 rows)

